{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["AIKa ZERO","Aika's story continues, she is now 19 years-old, 3 years older than in R-16 and 7 younger than in Agent AIKa. Strange phenomena have been occuring at a girls academy. Slowly but persistently the most cute and beautiful girls are joining an internal club, but instead of a sing-in they just get abducted by a strange being that takes control over them by some indecent means. \n\n\nBy coincidence Aika was flying-by on her plane when one of this abductions occurred and she was attacked to prevent her from comming closer, but instead of repelling her, she is intrigued about the attack's origin and then the opportunity shows up when her late partners from R-16 decide to investigate those abductions. The story remains full of action and panty flashing that are a must in Aika's series.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["AIKa ZERO",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":2163,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":366,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-6443","ids":{"shikimori":6443,"mal":6443,"anilist":6443,"kodik":"serial-22553"},"kodikIds":["serial-8265","serial-22552","serial-22553"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-8265":"2020-02-07T22:11:55Z","serial-22552":"2020-02-07T22:15:06Z","serial-22553":"2020-02-07T22:15:20Z"},"title":"Айка Зеро","originalTitle":"AIKa Zero","alt":"Айка Начало AIKa ZERO","description":"История Айки продолжается: теперь ей 19 лет — на три года больше, чем в «R-16», и на семь меньше, чем в «Агенте Айке». В женской академии начинают происходить странные вещи. Медленно, но неумолимо самые красивые и симпатичные девушки одна за другой вступают в некий закрытый клуб — вот только вместо вступительной церемонии их просто похищает загадочное существо, подчиняющее их себе весьма непристойным способом. По чистой случайности Айка Сумэраги пролетала мимо на своём самолёте именно в момент одного из таких похищений, и на неё напали, чтобы не дать подобраться ближе. Но вместо того, чтобы отступить, Айку это только заинтриговало — ей хочется узнать, откуда взялась эта угроза. Возможность для расследования подворачивается сама собой, когда её бывшие напарники из «R-16» решают разобраться в этих похищениях. История, как и полагается в мире Айки, остаётся насыщена динамичными сценами действия и, конечно же, мельканием трусиков.","year":2009,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Комедия","этти"],"rating":5.85,"popularity":5515,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[2163,366],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/6443/c4839f10e27ed4621fc4ec912940c717.jpeg","width":700,"height":980},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n6443-g3j8pEmxOaPt.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":0,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-8265","translationId":"767","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/582217/c75863a61170e90f9e6b56b7805a0b9b/720p","season":0,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":0,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-8265","translationId":"767","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/582218/a328f436ab3ce9bbb0ecb9fb5fd0bbaa/720p","season":0,"ordinal":2}}]},{"number":3,"ordinal":3,"season":0,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-8265","translationId":"767","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/582219/7